# Motion budget

Prefer in order: **CSS → AutoAnimate → React Spring → GSAP → Lottie → R3F**.

One UI surface = one motion engine. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

| Need | Use |
| --- | --- |
| List / filter / TOC DOM add\|remove\|move | AutoAnimate (`useAutoAnimate`) |
| Hover, `:target` equation highlight, copy feedback | CSS only |
| Mobile TOC drawer, calculator knobs / drag | React Spring (+ use-gesture if needed) |
| Landing / `/guide` scroll story (max 1–2 pin scenes) | GSAP + `@gsap/react` `useGSAP` + `matchMedia` |
| Icon / empty state (≤3 JSON, optional) | Lottie + static SVG fallback |
| Spatial schematic that teaches better in 3D | R3F lazy; else SVG 2D |

## Forbidden

- GSAP / Lottie / parallax inside chapter body KaTeX
- Stacking AutoAnimate + Spring + Lottie on the same region
- `window.addEventListener('scroll')` — use ScrollTrigger / CSS / IntersectionObserver
